  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS 6731 - PPG, GLOBAL BFO. UNDP will support countries to accelerate three transformational shifts: Resetting the narratives and behaviors that determine how we value nature; Systemic economic shifts to flows of finance from nature-negative to nature-positive outcomes; and, Ensuring that nature-based solutions feature prominently in inclusive and sustainable development policies.</narrative>
